# A small sealed headspace makes fizz push back
# Expectation: Acidifying 0.001 mol NaHCO3 with 0.002 mol HCl over a sealed 10 mL headspace should raise pressure above ambient and retain carbon.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
seal v1 10mL
add v1 NaHCO3 0.001mol
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
measure v1 pressure
inspect v1
